│    24                                                                                                                      │
│    25     This wrapper defers building the real ``aiomqtt.Client`` until                                                   │
│    26     ``_axiom_mqtt_connect_wrapper`` runs. It returns a small handle object                                           │
│    27     that carries the config and a dedicated event loop, so call sites can                                            │
