│   12     sendmail(sender, recipients, message) method transmits a raw RFC 5322                                             │
│   13     message over that connection.                                                                                     │
│   14                                                                                                                       │
│   15     apprise.Apprise() instead returns a notification dispatcher: you                                                  │
│   16     configure it with one or more service URLs (here, a mailto:// URL                                                 │
│   17     built from host/port) and call notify(title=..., body=...) to push a                                              │
│   18     message -- there is no persistent connection object and no                                                        │
│   19     sendmail() method.                                                                                                │
│   20                                                                                                                       │
│   21     This wrapper builds an apprise.Apprise() instance configured with a                                               │
│   22     mailto:// URL derived from host/port, and returns a small shim object                                             │
│   23     exposing sendmail(sender, recipients, message). That method parses                                                │
│   24     the raw RFC 5322 message text (pulling the Subject header and body                                                │
│   25     out of it) and forwards those as the title/body of an apprise                                                     │
│   26     notify() call, so the existing EmailNotifier.notify() code path that                                              │
│   27     calls self.smtp.sendmail(...) keeps working unmodified.                                                           │
│   28     """                                                                                                               │
